Package: pulsaros-welcome
Version: 2.0.9
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Jaime <info@inled.es>
Depends: libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libgtk-3-0, libsoup-3.0-0, libjavascriptcoregtk-4.1-0, librsvg2-2, x11-xserver-utils, python3-gi, python3-dbus, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, driverman, gstreamer1.0-libav, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad, gstreamer1.0-plugins-ugly, gstreamer1.0-gl
Description: Welcome application for Pulsar OS.
 Native Tauri welcome that detects live / first-boot (OOTB) / installed
 systems, shows an Apple-like hello animation, a feature slideshow, app
 compatibility, settings, Sayri and recovery, then closes by itself. Ships
 the OOTB and cleanup helpers to bring up a fresh user account.
